{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:924d676ec58126f8305ad9abe1d4fadf20e5e6a4e18e219b2c419178777561f7",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c28b3b25a16ac317df601943f9ee10292c12a7e57b8041e674d76ece986c58d8",
      "text": "站在起点",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:93cd0c0b8e7486f2132107577006c71e57c325c77440b61e9dd09e26b8f4e030",
      "text": "诚司在执行任务时失去了重要的后辈，自己\n左腿也负了伤，回到了日本。\n看着外甥女正迷恋着的偶像，\n他回想起了后辈曾经说过的一席话。\n另一方面，英雄在巡逻时发现的是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_a:cmd-000007:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7824b3a8948acd2c72636875e79b09adab6d8fca3c20b65cfcfd68e8d3eae4ba",
      "text": "第1话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_a:cmd-000007:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c28b3b25a16ac317df601943f9ee10292c12a7e57b8041e674d76ece986c58d8",
      "text": "站在起点",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_a:cmd-000009:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:188801b14fd3771fdce46c5ae365b83c239c17365dd504431df65aba2bc79c9f",
      "text": "（……竟然受了这种伤。\n明明还有那么多需要去救助的人）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_a:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1b34614d7a65030188616e4888fc1fb73c636d6932d9c8596b64bfd4239c2a89",
      "text": "信玄，在你处理伤口的时候打扰了，抱歉。\n……有件事我必须告诉你。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_a:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:beec21f5f83ac77df4fceb2658807df9deb4e3f4cc7b5e4b37b736611e6f3e64",
      "text": "这到底是怎么回事！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_a:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0c699f6067cc1ff94c6a044962174d9ab90e65e48624bb9608967e3e4be1c2d4",
      "text": "为什么这家伙会变成这副模样……！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_a:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:53b5ff829b69334d726886da3bc353a8e1793a38b42a0c2b5da0d7c0116dac62",
      "text": "听说是为了掩护孩子才没能及时撤离。\n被救的孩子只受了点擦伤。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_a:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7f5d83a60b8506023421d7e508f2e6f2b915d1b437571bf9d8c84af97ff9aa14",
      "text": "夸夸他吧，说他干得漂亮……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_a:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6c2f42b4a55753e9e62dd02f65b6356658d6cbe6e721c2568cbf980c1112bb7f",
      "text": "怎么会……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_a:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4678dab3c53d5275f246a7fba344cad876cb06e5cb526a9bc0a9632fe18617c1",
      "text": "哇啊啊啊啊啊！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_a:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c1615ad901d8221c04e6154356aa66a570b189091cfbdb99cbe12ae0086ae1ed",
      "text": "你也受了重伤，在这里没办法好好治疗。\n回日本去好好休养吧。……明白了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_a:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d29d4f15069c209b6fe9b17311067c9c46d1c41c111ff92920d1e569da5dd073",
      "text": "……有一件事，可以答应我吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_a:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:011cd5f00ecd7e0efcd6b46d9a7831b59128e87c72b04c6c05a6c49309a804c1",
      "text": "这家伙的身份牌……\n可以交由我来保管吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_b:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:df8403949b2a58254fbf065d168644952aef780426cea59ee75acbac29d648a8",
      "text": "哥，伤势恢复得怎么样了？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_b:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d65afbd33ab9695d477e1d3bab991af69a44c36791ce11e1f0b3ee35cb293e3a",
      "text": "嗯，康复训练挺顺利的。\n不过，果然没办法恢复到以前那样了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_b:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b6512789ed6959f2b08585c5a20526d51e9036dcbf9c8d6ea1f7db766be59607",
      "text": "这样啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_b:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3dfd3122549e0fd5002daf158171dac714447fd0535d8df7cc80af6190c2738f",
      "text": "我大概会就这样退役吧。\n抱歉，可能还要再给你们添一阵子麻烦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_b:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2010e9b6bbe226804fb69c6f9d0110cd7199b109addc327cf162b95e010b1474",
      "text": "根本不用道歉啦。\n现在你只要一门心思把伤养好就行。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_b:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9257716cf1e5fdc355f871cddd97b8ab77cfd2d9ef34f14b46ee707cdc780c11",
      "text": "以后的事，慢慢再去考虑不就好了嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_b:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da3fd37ff20095aea309a89863f98698fd6c25664ef3c382461762fd629e085d",
      "text": "……也是啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_b:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8f6910e9b0cd17f987a1feb4eb17527227d4eb688f38dd5e1c8453ce3341ff43",
      "text": "天音来帮舅舅施展痛痛飞走咒！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_b:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d0b6e8901cef54e00c6d957eb832d04bd8d9f484d85c812621302bac47e62ede",
      "text": "哈哈。谢谢你，天音。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_b:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fe6863023feb3fc736578919eb5f4549a2308d1db5fc0b5e9c6c1b1edc155fc2",
      "text": "哥，我借用一下厨房哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_b:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:afebac6b6b043e6648781dba05dddeaa18145c388a9be827191acb09c38bdb2a",
      "text": "好。我是无所谓……不过可千万别\n把整颗鸡蛋直接放进微波炉里啊？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_b:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b8723f9f15676594637161e59e147f21c82ca7a4b7abadff97077ef120d7336",
      "text": "都说了不会再犯了啦！真是的，\n不就仗着自己稍微会做点菜，就老爱瞎操心……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_b:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8f76bef23a02cefbcdcd98d11ce51a1d933d90dbdfd8f69583533f23fbcbdcad",
      "text": "水煮蛋也算做菜吗？\n……有点担心，果然还是我来帮忙吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_c:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:98ef6419df67064054eeaaf4605594a3cfd9ae01cb3fdf4914c0fe9f559e010f",
      "text": "呀——！是和真君！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_c:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:af15710672183fa1f38cb68bf3e9e4de232f1a79fc7fe552f8270c40cd35257d",
      "text": "天音在看什么呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_c:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:368cbd01a69cdc33cdbe8cfa5bcd65e69dde5620b9e949ea6a3d661cf16c50de",
      "text": "和真君！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_c:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4d945b70d9fcfbdb882bbcbfb25cbd118d44b6acd583e3ee99284d99be0fd7fa",
      "text": "是电视上播的偶像的名字啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_c:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fe677413b592ae499b845b5a08b977dac28ca060d2751e5e3d147fdf66043eb5",
      "text": "这孩子好像很喜欢偶像，\n看的时候一直都是笑眯眯的呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_c:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8567464a307a232b691f1d941730e204e1c2c3d4474b3a3e254baa42d74e1a19",
      "text": "（确实。满脸笑容，看得十分入迷呢……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_c:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3112face61702a6beeecc19dc8bd4bcbdc1da7fb5eb601bab1691f9ee8be55bb",
      "text": "天音，舅舅可以和你一起看吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_c:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:53fae0cff8a0a6b334d61e0732b130b8cc6bbf732024190aa56032d525947abf",
      "text": "好呀！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_c:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f62bb75943bdaf0e2521d3d3ba9bf0db9f87dca4501e396807855a794ac099a4",
      "text": "嘻嘻嘻，和真君好帅啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_c:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5aace04c34db54bce538d3f937bd0e1b95367168873595b7e6ad7dfc1f54ab10",
      "text": "（说起来，那家伙也曾经……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_c:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dd23e3dbff56ec486d6b1b94c68e11f06aae25de13fa4cd7082e42cdb8773eeb",
      "text": "我想要守护全世界的笑容。\n无论是谁，都需要一个能开怀大笑的地方吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_d:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:01c583f427778175703f176aeba2656b70bc66f2bf3e7bf6782ce118028fcac1",
      "text": "守护笑容，吗……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_d:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5848861695ab03b68f794c29c3867193a81ad5c7ac11c5509794db16148bd0a9",
      "text": "（聊到那个话题的时候，我记得\n也是像今天一样晴朗的日子吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_d:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6017bfb8f6f2f8479468d99a5cc88c1169b9489cf8a5947e74cde2e02e577ff6",
      "text": "守护和平那是理所当然的前提，绝对是！\n在那之外，我还有想守护的东西。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_d:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1ffde7d1981730afead681ff5ad8beb300ed49f213946328ed1681612a497fc9",
      "text": "在那之外？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_d:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d751d410e057696534e8d962a81b4b60867b34e9f8078c5b9c989a3033976ad8",
      "text": "就是笑容啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_d:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dd23e3dbff56ec486d6b1b94c68e11f06aae25de13fa4cd7082e42cdb8773eeb",
      "text": "我想要守护全世界的笑容。\n无论是谁，都需要一个能开怀大笑的地方吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_d:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:18c9560735a136c220d1bc4914979fec820c7ccc4233076e60242a4c448a1193",
      "text": "哈哈，原来如此！\n这不是很像你的作风嘛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_d:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a585dab00ae2868cbcedd75adf913de3f44e262a379aa733296b9a8c995cc750",
      "text": "这种想法，我可不讨厌！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_d:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ec8bf10ba1a0b37abb3ae1702b5f678b1dcf60033527acb66597c356dc70e158",
      "text": "天音的笑容，正被这位偶像守护着啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_d:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7a8616f3e606d3648d1a485e6e0f8185dae226356820e4312abf65386c1c7748",
      "text": "这也就是说，只要成为偶像……\n就能守护某人的笑容，守护全世界的笑容了吗……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_d:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c1d873c481ff7044018d6848a6afdc337c43af1b33a4f6e83b81297df00f6cb0",
      "text": "……我知道了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_e:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:297b4bce9bd4b9e8af4c7974ef49cfdc18b9aa0e1c10a0d3e9e88780385db990",
      "text": "突然叫这么大声，怎么了？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_e:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c88b1acbfc381ff0fc24d8a5337c91ffe8f160893db9742d0ea28764df2bd5e",
      "text": "和真君正在说话呢，要嘘——哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_e:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:628b8a794fc7b2cb37e28dd85adb2f368a3164e4b0122794341242a7e8d08030",
      "text": "啊、啊，抱歉抱歉。\n和真君很帅气呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_e:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:58b770a8e82e33de667ba4b0ff9914c02f8acce375ba5a285f585acd2838da21",
      "text": "所以我刚才想了想。\n我也要成为像和真君那样的人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_e:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b438c472aa0d5a0799d57466bfd4f57a6487009ce083b285b209a276ffedecf4",
      "text": "诶？也就是说……\n哥你也要去当偶像吗！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_e:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4485eccf262bd536496ce4eec773d5ad7ac1c6b40abcf8d4f22b311b2dee88e5",
      "text": "嗯，差不多就是这个意思！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_e:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5518ac8dd4c24a12f536a846796a2a755ded09e4bb89e258f0b2a41ad940de18",
      "text": "……后辈曾经说过，\n他想守护全世界的笑容。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_e:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:07d66a9159362744f76e69ad51ae87ff4e3e7060cb50042c8560b302f930a778",
      "text": "我想继承那家伙的遗志。\n而能够做到这一点的，我觉得就是偶像了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_e:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cdd27d795d806674c9417840fc486d85554b1eb6b9d722b261b7dba6ed6d16ce",
      "text": "……如果这是哥你想做的事，\n我全力支持。不过……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_e:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:10af5c269c7b50cfb24458128cc71c0b2d1c7fc61cf9f6cad696827342e77b77",
      "text": "为了那个目标，现在必须要静养！\n对吧，天音。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_e:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:81d2aaefebd137b48ce198950665a754dee520f948883dab314abfa0d7d12e84",
      "text": "嗯！痛痛要快点飞走治好！\n那样的话，就能变得像和真君一样了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_e:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:10e627ed0e744583a7674ddfcf01c1742c2da4d3db69185e815423424aa866b6",
      "text": "哈哈，说的也是。先把这条腿养好，\n我也要成为能够守护天音笑容的偶像！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_f:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:395e1e0587dd4b9f9651c99d8688715f896c700b3636d0c7194d15a0e800904d",
      "text": "…………",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_f:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0115724c608d741c8106f51a555cfaf7ac02d874de12c3cf5fc98339c62884ca",
      "text": "（那个时候，我到底该怎么跟他们搭话才对？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_f:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cc2a057f37a64fbb8084bfed0085d30b98a15605724c9c7a04d1cf0801be35bd",
      "text": "你还敢告状！不就顺手牵羊拿了点东西吗！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_f:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9575efc0a42a7965c539311e8383f0727d77239b7992073d099db1d31344caed",
      "text": "顺手牵羊拿了点东西，你这孩子……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_f:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a3be990267c832a7305a8625cfb9034f2f051e277d09f87b617e760f85bd34fe",
      "text": "你这个笨蛋，我不是告诉过你\n别被人抓到吗！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_f:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:85d38702cce99e090d47c1e1339f4076adb8bba9964e704821a0225aa36f6042",
      "text": "不是我，是他太笨了才被发现的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_f:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5999fb8c439aedc310fc22e9b23faada72dc7422a48e55a6526491f7b19cc31",
      "text": "…………",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_f:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b1d0704a4d2eedaf668ffaec79d146854af4d73667b6273374a686296d4b735a",
      "text": "好、好了好了。\n这位家长，请冷静一下……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_f:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:53efab9e3ccb2daa5d8e37b9e2067562606fb43a43fee6095858f51659314c5d",
      "text": "（……错的不是这群孩子）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_f:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b8d4b0052e88d2cf8cbc23692af7674a64e87e561eab2f53f40e7235af0c376",
      "text": "（是大人们放弃了他们、\n不去传达重要的事情才造成的）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_f:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4680fbf85b847587edf91849d4f1a19e0c94db4f46cf4344e57fb973378f35a2",
      "text": "（“别被人抓到”……不对，这群孩子\n需要的绝对不是这种话……！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_f:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6724b84590729da2f6a9f168cca5a61a38de9ab944ea3c66694f54ab120ec610",
      "text": "怎么了？巡逻的时候可别发呆啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_f:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:611eee6b9775b9af8aba23260cfca8f5f9ab6a17519f441b316b1c49f9a28cf6",
      "text": "！……抱、抱歉。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_f:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d036120341ffd9a765300f226bb9b94bb8ecf4f3777d58a1474da27d88bc6ac5",
      "text": "这附近看起来没什么异常。\n好，去下一个地方吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_g:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:204a0dc8e5f800dd46f810ba370f9443fc44ce83d55fd879c6d0e569a6a16c08",
      "text": "接下来，去游戏厅附近看看吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_g:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:494ca50a0094b223e45c557a577b25351f425ceac40992d7eb2c42330ac30755",
      "text": "也好。这个时间，\n大家应该都聚在那个片区吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_g:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fdaad132fbc44da85be85697524c6e45eef7f192147f260063eb9b32b3e8c42b",
      "text": "那我们就拐进那条路，\n往主干道走吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_g:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e1cc7c2b2a0952748bc624e2292df918fa0a576fd59c3075b324a3f95a9ee0d5",
      "text": "明白了。\n希望今天也能平平安安结束巡逻。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_g:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:998ae0176332896f2d591e274fd4002d4a01756c60644184f87208d9779af506",
      "text": "……嗯？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_g:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:198ca88a3720d4631ceec16d5658967435af0b3e8fdeb7da1049f785b4946030",
      "text": "那张海报是什么？\n这附近以前有贴过那种东西吗……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_g:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:787de4e7c4f2e3d8800f13826d04086917f344d61c8e711b92752b98f6173e26",
      "text": "……“偶像招募”？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_g:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:73bd77186f06046fcbe2ebf2e7dac9d78202a4eb990036ebcf30680a0fb61266",
      "text": "怎么了，愣在那儿。\n……嗯？是什么试镜的海报啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_g:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5417acc9f842a3851693d639db7aad15815d8b6fac2543af8a895ccd3002c999",
      "text": "你对这种东西感兴趣吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_g:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:804a4dbc7a58841966e8d2b3fcf43c8a57faabe6172e5752ffcd4d6e2b9b3450",
      "text": "没，倒不是那个意思……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_h:cmd-000010:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:08aed2ff999dc839bf2359ee896cb4d3eb61cdc4149500e0527827cb7d6db1e5",
      "text": "315 Production……\n偶像招募，试镜……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_h:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d4a4220fa93e9c010a0eaadc558144b9610f522cdc38031366c9d66e7e25689b",
      "text": "说起来，最近好像有哪里的偶像发了新歌呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_h:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:23061b1f9a65d2bd867b4ed78a958ebb8abba70a9a78410ea60d2889c581d76d",
      "text": "啊——歌名叫什么来着。\n旋律我倒是记得一清二楚了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_h:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de4ec5e52a8b4cb62403828fb86bfef1f358d69a85b31ca4f690d1514e4a2812",
      "text": "我也是。不管去哪里都在放，\n街上遇到的孩子们好像也超级喜欢的样子。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_h:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:16a1f994e261a2fc20ddf3008c3a3cc83bb818dc0e4339623efcc82511bf6642",
      "text": "……要是他们对我们说的话，也能抱有\n同样的兴趣就好了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_h:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c1e620cca85ccc7a3911fb26b80993173ba05e1ce404d38c37900777028032b7",
      "text": "哈哈，也是啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_h:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aa61e1a4482438e8d31312fa4dfe1068e55b7a74588751941b0b4050323ad9d0",
      "text": "（不对，等等。说起来……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_h:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9dc110c44d0918d9478103ba82695377df4c0c81e242f8991380ceac31bcdd47",
      "text": "（孩子们聚集的地方，\n总是放着各种各样的歌）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_h:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c5cd18656aa73786866258edb4dfef878093d5f3715f1ecddf6806267a717fb0",
      "text": "（如果是歌声的话，就能自然而然流入他们的耳朵……\n要是在那首歌里，融入想要传达的言语与心意的话……？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_h:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:58b6c692193bb331ef2a4736490b332292ed00f0b780c8b477294f131e16d45b",
      "text": "对了，就是这个！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_i:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:329d3e6a588530f4ff82e61fa702a1fcfed63edb7f9a2a75c8e07a27025ee9fd",
      "text": "如果我成为偶像，把心意寄托在歌声里，\n那群家伙说不定就会听进去了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_i:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7686dcfc2d16532689ba41ee86869c9ab4116bc6014c15f25b5f5a76ec73934d",
      "text": "你……当偶像？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_i:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:56235cba386fc28491d7bf353629450ff44f31eb5a003e7a5a8d715fd5c349d0",
      "text": "干、干嘛啊，那副表情……\n我想要当偶像很奇怪吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_i:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e1504962bbf6a1af80da8918852ef58c90584a2381f81397c1d1dc7d68ff6136",
      "text": "不，倒不是奇怪。\n只是觉得你怎么突然冒出这么离谱的念头。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_i:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7cfea8cdd88a9b9247f37cbcf4ee3afd27e56a3c6800093d3b7ce6987750a935",
      "text": "而且，偶像给人的印象一般都是“笑容”吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_i:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f23597eb0b35f6dd0d1b837570d6b00c168903b2319693770606b9cc7793319f",
      "text": "你之前对着迷路的孩子微笑，\n结果把人家吓哭了不是吗……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_i:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ff18099541d44dfb567582089a1bb7538ab3845e3f2d20afc34473c7d93a3ba8",
      "text": "啊——……笑、笑容吗……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_i:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:267e9e46879485b5952002bede82d4c278f2b3dbe348b733891692d18a1f8fc6",
      "text": "确实我这张脸经常吓到别人啊……\n眼神凶恶也是一个原因吧……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_i:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a9317edc079e0b60f999f30a7a0ec4a41cc1fc4d0fd8db4e747a1e4215ef146e",
      "text": "……但是，我想要把心声传达给那些孩子们。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_i:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8363f9662be1d449325c79b68e783ffec6ce7cdae58e72dbe7042f481b19deaf",
      "text": "传达给那些正感受着孤独、不安，\n无处安放心思的家伙们。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_i:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d3b0b346461d223833e34341a8df29299c3130ffc6b2997ee13cb29dceba5108",
      "text": "我想要告诉他们，有我在支撑着他们……\n你并不是孤单一人！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_j:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9a0b1ff0596b47f666da08384c1ad1316acd0d04b67f771898fec1a400c86fc5",
      "text": "要是有能把这些话传达给那帮小鬼的方法，\n我愿意放手一搏。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_j:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:38c359a37374300671fa4b7c40013ee5d0ee5bb70bd41c3259026a7eb3340a55",
      "text": "只要是倾注了全部心意的歌声，\n或许多多少少也能在他们心中激起回响吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_j:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ca89a88f9b7c040b2c1318b18367f76460cf83a9690a1cec106b0e1db6b15fd2",
      "text": "要是能因此减少做坏事的家伙的话……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_j:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1efbed1d7598ea80a895d72c3c851ac9728f0e8e3cd1d8c3e38b712618b3028a",
      "text": "话是这么说没错啦……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_j:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:970972bbefe3920b0416c4c162575a9dd643d2681f31772fba4a591e285b4fa4",
      "text": "谢谢你替我担心。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_j:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:74d9af59766d7e3947cfe5a9064dbfa8ef28dd7824bccad48b07d86583f51c08",
      "text": "虽然不知道当不当得上，\n但总比什么都不做要好吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_j:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6dbce9948f28733f8fdaac99679a24f4390be8d5b7fb2ccae89e089033575860",
      "text": "既然决定了，就得先看看招募条件才行。\n我看看，上面写着……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_01_1_1_006_01:1_1_006_01_j:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:41b287c7d5f08110c213578bebf04b18924594f837256ff23eeee6314d5f131d",
      "text": "喂、喂喂，你是认真的吗！？",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
